diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index ad329e2..a2d10c3 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
 - `python -m kestrel day THERAPIST_ID DATE --data FILE` lists a therapist's appointments on a local (Auckland) date.
 - `python -m kestrel patients --data FILE` lists patient IDs and names, sorted by ID.
 - `Calendar.for_day(therapist_id, day)` returns a therapist's appointments on a local date, sorted by start.
+- `Calendar.upcoming(patient_id, now)` returns a patient's booked appointments starting after `now`, soonest first.
 - `Calendar.cancel(appointment_id, at)` cancels a booked appointment and records `cancelled_at`.
 - `Calendar.move` reschedules a booked appointment to a new start time.
 - `Patient.csc` flags Community Services Card holders (default `False`; older files still load).
